    "tree_id": "a8a568688f8d87212532a5bf88ac89ab970d80c8",
    "message": "launcher: POSIX giu argv[0] goc, ghim tep da bam qua Popen(executable=) (#1335 PR #1341 connector P2)\n\nConnector Codex (comment 4587298084): thay argv[0] bang realpath lam chuong trinh phu thuoc duong\ngoi doi moi truong — venv/bin/python (symlink) chay thanh Python he thong, mat venv.\n- POSIX: lenh_con giu argv[0] goc; tep da bam duoc ghim bang `executable=<realpath>` o _phong, nen\n  tep chay van la tep da bam (TOCTOU symlink van dong, r1335_symlink + dot bien N3c).\n- Windows: giu thay argv[0] bang duong da bam (hanh vi N5 da do xanh). Khong doi vi `executable=`\n  thanh lpApplicationName cua CreateProcess, chua do voi .cmd; venv Windows mac dinh la ban sao\n  nen realpath trung chinh no. Chua do venv tao bang --symlinks tren Windows.\n- Ca r1335_giu_argv0_goc_khi_ghim_tep (venv symlink that, doi sys.prefix != sys.base_prefix va\n  bam = realpath Python): DO tren 9aec797, xanh sau va; Windows BO QUA co khai. Dot bien\n  r1335_argv0_ve_realpath; needle N3c doi sang bo `executable=`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrbndnJN1DaSQJUfHYH",
